- **Example.** `[↯/s.127.1.1] the WebDriver action failed because the requested element was not found: no such element: Unable to locate element: {"method":"css selector","selector":"#absent"}`
+ **Пример.** `[↯/s.127.1.1] the WebDriver action failed because the requested element was not found: no such element: Unable to locate element: {"method":"css selector","selector":"#absent"}`

